    <string name="stats_privacy_header">PRIVACY &amp; DATA SAFETY</string>
    <string name="stats_privacy_desc">Inkify stores your books and reading data locally on your device. If you enable Google Drive Sync, backups are stored exclusively in your private Google Drive AppData folder.</string>
    <string name="stats_privacy_view_btn">View Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="stats_privacy_web_btn">Open Web Link</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_url">https://github.com/Maris-LTD/E-ink-simulation/blob/master/docs/privacy-policy.md</string>
    <string name="privacy_dialog_title">Privacy Policy — Inkify</string>
    <string name="privacy_dialog_body">1. Data Storage &amp; Ownership\n• All imported books (EPUB, PDF, CBZ), reading progress, bookmarks, highlights, and statistics are stored locally on your device.\n• Inkify does not operate any third-party tracking servers, analytics SDKs, or advertising networks.\n\n2. Google Sign-In &amp; Google Drive Sync (Optional)\n• When you sign in with Google, Inkify accesses your basic email/display name and the private Google Drive AppData folder (drive.appdata scope).\n• Your synced books and reading progress are stored exclusively inside your own Google Drive account.\n• You can delete individual books from Google Drive or delete your entire cloud backup at any time in Profile &amp; Stats → Settings → Google Drive Sync.\n\n3. Dictionary &amp; Translation\n• When you look up or translate selected text while reading, only the selected word/phrase is sent over HTTPS to dictionary/translation endpoints.\n\n4. Permissions Used\n• INTERNET: Used only for optional Google Drive Sync and dictionary lookup.\n• POST_NOTIFICATIONS: Used for optional Lock Screen reading controls.\n• ACCESS_NOTIFICATION_POLICY: Used only when you enable Focus Mode (Do Not Disturb).\n• QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES (MAIN/LAUNCHER intent): Used solely by the optional eInk Home Launcher to list launchable apps in the App Drawer.\n\n5. Contact\n• For any privacy questions or data requests, contact: letuandat556@gmail.com</string>
